"source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head of the Hinomori family. A major landowner whose name is synonymous with the land itself. Her husband is an adopted son-in-law and is currently on a business trip overseas."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a hard-to-approach, dignified woman, but she approaches Masaaki with abnormally sensual physical contact."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason, she suggests a game to wipe away Masaaki's debt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is in her late 30s."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c156624"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"その土地に名前は付く程の大地主、檜乃森家の当主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は婿養子で現在、海外出張中である。近寄りがたい威厳に満ちた女性だが、雅章に対しては異常な程、淫靡なスキンシップを行ってくる。オブジェの弁償金を帳消しにするゲームを何故か提案してくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28478","sourceWorkId":"39358","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"その土地に名前は付く程の大地主、檜乃森家の当主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は婿養子で現在、海外出張中である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近寄りがたい威厳に満ちた女性だが、雅章に対しては異常な程、淫靡なスキンシップを行ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オブジェの弁償金を帳消しにするゲームを何故か提案してくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"192749"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/292e20aa2b093078a4e736f34b80476e1ac4f07048fb376ca3ed76f5b5bb4889.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26034ade6803aa234f8191f6a48f06164da6ef7e99686821babd9d66bbd8c7e6.webp","width":217,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"有賀桃","creatorId":"vndb:s649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s649","name":"平野響子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101157","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c156625","characterName":"榛原 永久","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"192751","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"585782"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28479"],"vndbCharacterId":"c156625"},"originalCharacterName":"榛原 永久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head maid from Haibara family, who have served the Hinomori family for generations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband is an adopted son-in-law who works outside the estate, so they're estranged, meeting only about once a year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's usually a kind, capable woman who takes good care of others, but for some reason, despite being married, she harbors wicked, indecent feelings toward Masaaki and tries to seduce him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is in her late 30s."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c156625"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々檜乃森家に仕える榛原家のメイド長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は婿養子で屋敷外で働いている為、一年に一回程しか会っていない程疎遠である。普段は面倒見が良く優しく仕事が出来る女性だが、何故か人妻でありながら雅章に対して邪で淫靡な感情を抱き、エッチをしようとしてくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28479","sourceWorkId":"39358","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々檜乃森家に仕える榛原家のメイド長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は婿養子で屋敷外で働いている為、一年に一回程しか会っていない程疎遠である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は面倒見が良く優しく仕事が出来る女性だが、何故か人妻でありながら雅章に対して邪で淫靡な感情を抱き、エッチをしようとしてくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"192751"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e1b49233d18f6bc8c49d0c767d39b1100f721f8799daeb6e6c560a6ab82bd0f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/530fd1966d49d295feec53d11d169c0076439863a5dbbdc92f7c0a858c165a68.webp","width":215,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101156","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c156626","characterName":"榛原 碧桜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"192752","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"585782"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28480"],"vndbCharacterId":"c156626"},"originalCharacterName":"榛原 碧桜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Second-year student at Ayatsuji University, and a maid at the Hinomori household."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Towa's daughter, and has worked as a maid for the Hinomori family since childhood. She entered university to learn about the outside world. There she met Masaaki and they became close friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sociable, laid-back woman, she is liked by everyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She comes back to the Hinomori mansion after proposing to Masaaki that he work part-time there during summer break."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c156626"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"綾辻大学二年生兼檜乃森家メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"永久の娘あり、幼少時から檜乃森家でメイドとして働いていたが、外の世界を学ぶ為に大学に入学する。そこで雅章に出会い親友となる。社交的でサバサバしていて誰からも好かれる女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、夏休み中の檜乃森家でのバイトを雅章に提案し、戻ってくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28480","sourceWorkId":"39358","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"綾辻大学二年生兼檜乃森家メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"永久の娘あり、幼少時から檜乃森家でメイドとして働いていたが、外の世界を学ぶ為に大学に入学する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで雅章に出会い親友となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交的でサバサバしていて誰からも好かれる女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、夏休み中の檜乃森家でのバイトを雅章に提案し、戻ってくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"192752"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a7ffef88b06144eb831296a10d0753fc2fa4a0c762faee152b61b3f5e3d216e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6be7ce14074507e0f9fb12ee844708ca2bdf0968b102a39f3185c6eb01bd91e3.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蒼乃 むすび","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101161","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c156627","characterName":"檜乃森 朱夏","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"192753","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"585782"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28481"],"vndbCharacterId":"c156627"},"originalCharacterName":"檜乃森 朱夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Young lady of the Hinomori family, and a student."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the daughter of Kohaku, but their relationship is strained and they have grown distant. She is the picture of a refined, elegant young lady, yet possesses abundant drive and curiosity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Perhaps out of rebellion against her mother, she offers to help search for Masaaki's pledge document."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c156627"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"檜乃森家令嬢兼学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小羽玖の娘だが、あまり親子仲はよろしくなく、疎遠になっている。清楚、上品と絵に描いたようなお嬢様だが、行動力と好奇心は旺盛である。母親への反発からか雅章の誓約書探しの協力を申し出てくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28481","sourceWorkId":"39358","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"檜乃森家令嬢兼学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小羽玖の娘だが、あまり親子仲はよろしくなく、疎遠になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚、上品と絵に描いたようなお嬢様だが、行動力と好奇心は旺盛である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親への反発からか雅章の誓約書探しの協力を申し出てくれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"192753"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5e97626694b54cdc87dcb110e437d0d5ce7757c6e26ec95625a1f643dc7c2739.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d7d1e03cf128cffef197d99bfc718ed9e4144811dc148e372535fc03862c16e.webp","width":216,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎本 ねむ","creatorId":"vndb:s25620","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25620","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25620","name":"益子 優衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101162","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c156628","characterName":"支部 雅章","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["28477"],"vndbCharacterId":"c156628"},"originalCharacterName":"支部 雅章","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. Second-year student at Ayatsuji University."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Invited by his classmate, Haibara Ao, he ends up taking a summer job as a servant at the mansion of the Hinomori family, a wealthy landowner outside the city. However, during his time there, he accidentally breaks an expensive item worth hundreds of millions of yen, saddling him with a huge bill."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, the head of the family, Hinomori Kohaku, proposes a peculiar game, which forces him to make every effort to have the debt canceled."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c156628"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。綾辻大学二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大学の同級生、榛原碧桜（はいばら あお）に誘われて、郊外の大地主、檜乃森家の屋敷で夏休み中使用人としてバイトする事になったが、その途中で時価数億円もする高価なオブジェを壊してしまい、多額の弁償金を背負う。しかし、当主小羽玖から妙なゲームを提案され、弁償金帳消しの為に奔走する事になってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28477","sourceWorkId":"39358","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c156822","characterName":"榛原  刑二","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c156822"},"originalCharacterName":"榛原  刑二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Butler to the Hinomori family, father to Towa, and grandfather to Ao."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is in his mid 60s."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c156822"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a81a0853f861528b74b0364a23cba0e8168826f11b8a04d69e79b378c5db393b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/285c06bd4d1efb4144d71d38083aeca74408d9ea5445f76f375803dfbca53568.webp","width":204,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"芦久比 剥巳","creatorId":"vndb:s6146","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6146","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6146","name":"加藤 寛規","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:101159","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c156823","characterName":"高井戸 七井","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c156823"},"originalCharacterName":"高井戸 七井","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"sour